  "copy": "<p class=\"about-eyebrow about-reveal\" style=\"--reveal-index: 0;\"><span class=\"about-eyebrow-line\"></span>01 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE CODE</p><h2 class=\"about-heading about-reveal\" id=\"about-heading\" style=\"--reveal-index: 1;\">More than code.<br>I build <span>experiences.</span></h2><div class=\"about-story about-reveal\" style=\"--reveal-index: 2;\"><p>I\u2019m Sumit, a software developer focused on turning complex problems into intuitive digital products. I work across frontend interfaces, backend systems, and automation workflows\u2014bringing ideas from concept to functional applications.</p><p>My work spans responsive applications, REST APIs, authentication, testing, and production deployments, with a focus on usability, reliability, and performance.</p></div><ol class=\"about-focus-list\" aria-label=\"My focus areas\"><li class=\"about-focus-row about-reveal\" style=\"--reveal-index: 3;\"><span class=\"about-focus-number\">01</span><div class=\"about-focus-copy\"><h3>Build</h3><p>Responsive interfaces and scalable full-stack applications.</p></div><span class=\"about-focus-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></li><li class=\"about-focus-row about-reveal\" style=\"--reveal-index: 4;\"><span class=\"about-focus-number\">02</span><div class=\"about-focus-copy\"><h3>Engineer</h3><p>REST APIs, authentication, and reliable database-backed systems.</p></div><span class=\"about-focus-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></li><li class=\"about-focus-row about-reveal\" style=\"--reveal-index: 5;\"><span class=\"about-focus-number\">03</span><div class=\"about-focus-copy\"><h3>Automate</h3><p>Practical workflows and integrations that reduce repetitive work.</p></div><span class=\"about-focus-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></li></ol><div class=\"about-signature about-reveal\" style=\"--reveal-index: 6;\"><div class=\"about-identity\"><p class=\"about-name\">SUMIT THAKUR</p><p class=\"about-role\">Software Developer <span>/</span> Full-Stack Developer</p><p class=\"about-location\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2316</span> Delhi NCR, India</p></div><a class=\"about-contact-link\" href=\"#contact\">Let\u2019s talk <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></div>",
